# TimeVault settings (template).
#
# English
# -------
# Copy this file to ".env" next to timevault-server.exe (or into the folder you start it from), replace every
# <placeholder> and remove the lines you do not need. The service reads the file itself when it starts. A setting
# that is also present in the process environment wins over this file (the start-up log names every setting it
# overrides). TIMEVAULT_ENV_FILE=<path> names another file; it must exist. Never commit a filled-in copy: it holds
# passwords. See docs/runbook.md.
#
# This file holds only what the service needs before it can reach its database, and its secrets. Everything else
# (the address people use, sign-in options, workers, the scheduler, search, updates, logging) is a Site setting: the
# local administrator edits it on the Site settings page (/settings/site) and it is stored in the database. A Site
# setting that is still written in this file is ignored, and the start-up log names it. The monitored folders and
# their schedules are managed on the Settings page and stored in the database too.
#
# 中文
# ----
# 把此文件复制为 timevault-server.exe 旁边的 ".env"（或你启动服务时所在的文件夹），替换每个 <占位符>，并删除不需要
# 的行。服务启动时自己读取该文件。进程环境中同名的设置优先于此文件（启动日志会点名被它覆盖的设置）。
# TIMEVAULT_ENV_FILE=<路径> 可指定另一个文件，该文件必须存在。不要提交填写过的副本：里面有密码。见 docs/runbook.md。
#
# 此文件只放服务在能连上数据库之前就需要的设置，以及机密。其余一切（人们使用的地址、登录选项、工作线程、调度器、
# 搜索、更新、日志）都是"站点设置"：由本地管理员在"站点设置"页（/settings/site）编辑，保存在数据库中。仍写在此文件里的
# 站点设置会被忽略，启动日志会点名它们。监控文件夹及其计划在"设置"页管理，同样保存在数据库中。

# --- Listener / 监听 ---------------------------------------------------------
# Loopback by default. Anyone who can reach this address can browse the backed-up files, and the user accounts'
# passwords are sent to it: put a TLS reverse proxy in front before other computers use it.
# 默认只监听本机回环地址。能访问该地址的人都能浏览已备份的文件，用户账号的密码也会发送到这里：让其他电脑使用之前，
# 请在前面放一个 TLS 反向代理。
TIMEVAULT_LISTEN_ADDR=127.0.0.1:8660
# Only when listening on a non-loopback address that a TLS reverse proxy protects.
# 仅在监听非回环地址且由 TLS 反向代理保护时使用。
# TIMEVAULT_ALLOW_NON_LOOPBACK=true

# --- PostgreSQL -------------------------------------------------------------
TIMEVAULT_DATABASE_URL=postgres://timevault:<password>@127.0.0.1:5432/<database>
# true applies migrations at start; otherwise run "timevault-server migrate" first. Needed for automatic updates.
# true 表示启动时应用迁移；否则请先运行 "timevault-server migrate"。自动更新需要它。
TIMEVAULT_AUTO_MIGRATE=false

# --- Storage / 存储 -----------------------------------------------------------
# Backup folder (the repository): where the contents of the backed-up files are stored. Keep it separate from every
# monitored folder; empty or already a TimeVault repository. Changing it needs a restart.
# 备份文件夹（仓库）：保存已备份文件内容的地方。请与所有监控文件夹分开；为空，或已经是 TimeVault 仓库。修改后需要重启。
TIMEVAULT_REPOSITORY_PATH=<path-to-backup-folder>
# Restore folder: a restore never overwrites the original files. It writes the restored copies into a new folder
# below this one, and you copy back what you need. Empty disables restore. It must not be inside or contain the
# repository or a monitored folder.
# 恢复文件夹：恢复从不覆盖原文件。它把恢复出的副本写入此文件夹下的新文件夹，由你把需要的内容复制回去。留空则禁用恢复。
# 它不得位于仓库或监控文件夹之内，也不得包含它们。
TIMEVAULT_RESTORE_ROOT=<path-to-restore-folder>

# --- Sign-in / 登录 -----------------------------------------------------------
# Anyone can browse without signing in. Backing up, restoring, the audit log and the settings need an account.
# 任何人都可以不登录浏览。备份、恢复、审计日志和设置需要账号。
#
# Company accounts are read from Redis (the app_user_* hashes). Check the connection with:
#   timevault-server check-redis-users
# redis://[:password]@host:port/db  (rediss:// for TLS). The account's Type "admin" may change the monitored
# folders; every other active account may back up and restore. The Redis is also where the web log goes (the web
# log settings are Site settings).
# 公司账号从 Redis 读取（app_user_* 哈希）。用下面的命令检查连接：
#   timevault-server check-redis-users
# redis://[:密码]@主机:端口/库号（TLS 用 rediss://）。账号类型为 "admin" 的可以修改监控文件夹；其他有效账号可以备份和恢复。
# Web 日志也写入这个 Redis（Web 日志的设置是站点设置）。
TIMEVAULT_REDIS_URL=redis://:<password>@127.0.0.1:6379/0
# TIMEVAULT_REDIS_KEY_PREFIX=app_user_
# TIMEVAULT_REDIS_TIMEOUT=3s
#
# Local administrator. Only this account may open the Site settings page, and it can still sign in when Redis is
# down. Leave both lines out for none (then the Site settings can only be changed with "timevault-server settings").
# 本地管理员。只有这个账号可以打开"站点设置"页，并且 Redis 不可用时它仍能登录。两行都不写表示没有（这时站点设置只能用
# "timevault-server settings" 修改）。
# TIMEVAULT_ADMIN_USER=admin
# Output of: timevault-server hash-password
# TIMEVAULT_ADMIN_PASSWORD_HASH=<hash-from-hash-password>
#
# Base64 text that decodes to at least 32 random bytes; keeps sessions across restarts.
# Base64 文本，解码后至少 32 个随机字节；让会话在重启后仍然有效。
TIMEVAULT_SESSION_KEY=<base64-of-32-or-more-random-bytes>
